---
// Figma: "Button / Help & tour", "Recentre" and "Zoom controls" (bottom-right of the map).
---
<button type="button" class="absolute left-[1077px] top-[767px] flex items-center gap-[7px] overflow-clip whitespace-nowrap rounded-[999px] ring-1 ring-inset ring-line bg-white px-[14px] py-[10px] text-ink-2">
  <span class="text-[13px] leading-normal font-bold">?</span>
  <span class="text-[12px] leading-[1.4] font-semibold">Help &amp; tour</span>
</button>

<button type="button" class="absolute left-[1197px] top-[767px] flex items-center gap-[8px] overflow-clip rounded-[999px] ring-1 ring-inset ring-line bg-white px-[14px] py-[10px]">
  <span class="size-[11px] shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>
  <span class="whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-[1.4] font-semibold text-ink-2">Recentre</span>
</button>

<div class="absolute left-[1358px] top-[716px] flex flex-col items-start overflow-clip rounded-[14px] ring-1 ring-inset ring-line bg-white shadow-[0px_2px_10px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)]">
  <button type="button" aria-label="Zoom in" class="flex w-[42px] justify-center py-[10px] text-[17px] leading-[1.4] font-bold text-ink-2">+</button>
  <button type="button" aria-label="Zoom out" class="flex w-[42px] justify-center py-[10px] text-[17px] leading-[1.4] font-bold text-ink-2">–</button>
</div>
